WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.716
This is Timeline. It lays out your week.

00:00:02.716 --> 00:00:08.556
Your school runs a Week A and Week B pattern, and the page shows which one you are in.

00:00:08.556 --> 00:00:12.562
Colours show what is school, football, study and free time.

00:00:12.562 --> 00:00:17.519
Exams, tests and holidays are marked, so you can spot a heavy week early.

00:00:17.519 --> 00:00:21.390
If next week looks packed, you can move work forward now.

00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:24.921
No nasty surprises. Try it now: find your next test.

